title: "Arbiter: Operational Reasoning System for Complex Domains"
abstract: "Operational Reasoning System combining formal ontology with neural AI for enterprise decision-making across complex domains. Domain-agnostic engine configured through YAML is in production for technical support, in development for infrastructure operations, and planned for financial services, healthcare, and legal."
